## 5. Delivery Phases

### Phase 5a — Dependencies + API Facade (1–2 days)
- `pnpm add three @react-three/fiber @react-three/drei`
- Add API facade methods (gaps 1–6)
- Add resource hooks (gaps 7–11)
- Tests for all facade methods and hooks
- **Gate:** typecheck + lint + test pass

### Phase 5b — Domain Adapters + Geometry Builders (2–3 days)
- `SpatialDomainAdapter` interface
- `FdmDomainAdapter` with `buildCuboidGeometry()`
- `FemDomainAdapter` with `buildTetBoundaryGeometry()`
- `createDomainAdapter()` factory
- `buildViewport3DRenderModel()` pure function
- Face → object mapping
- Unit tests for all adapters and geometry builders
- **Gate:** typecheck + lint + test pass

### Phase 5c — Single-Pane Viewport (2–3 days)
- Module manifest + `Viewport3DModule.tsx`
- Viewport store (camera, layout, pane config)
- `<ViewportPane>` with single `<Canvas frameloop="demand">`
- `<ObjectMeshLayer>` — renders cuboids or tets from render model
- `<SyncedOrbitControls>` (single pane → just orbit controls)
- Basic shaded rendering
- Verify: zero idle frames, data loads, camera works
- **Gate:** typecheck + lint + test pass

### Phase 5d — Field Visualization + LOD (2–3 days)
- `<ScalarFieldLayer>` — vertex/instance color mapping
- `<VectorGlyphLayer>` — instanced arrows, density-aware subsampling
- `<WireframeLayer>` — edge overlay
- `<AirboxLayer>` — separate layer, visibility toggle
- `<AxesGridLayer>`, `<BoundsBoxLayer>`
- Quantity switching without topology rebuild
- `glyphSampling.ts` — stride-based subsampling
- `lodStrategy.ts` — LOD thresholds
- **Gate:** typecheck + lint + test pass, quantity switch test

### Phase 5e — Multi-Viewport Grid (2–3 days)
- `<ViewportGrid>` with CSS grid layouts
- Multiple `<ViewportPane>` with per-pane layer config
- Camera sync via shared store + `SyncedOrbitControls`
- Per-pane toolbar (display mode, layer toggles)
- Layout presets (single, split-h, split-v, quad, one-plus-two)
- Maximise / restore
- Keyboard shortcuts
- **Gate:** typecheck + lint + test pass

### Phase 5f — Picking, Probing, Selection (2 days)
- `<SelectionHighlightLayer>` — outline/tint
- `useProbeValue()` — raycasting → object ID + cell + field value
- `<ProbeTooltip>` — hover/click value readout
- Face → object resolution via element markers
- `viewport:object-picked` event → kernel selection
- **Gate:** typecheck + lint + test pass

### Phase 5g — Polish + Verification (2 days)
- `<ClipPlaneLayer>`
- Memory stress test (3D↔2D switches, quantity cycles, layout changes)
- Idle performance audit (zero frames)
- Context loss recovery verification
- Large simulation test (1M cells)
- Diagnostics surface
- **Gate:** all gates pass, visual review

**Total estimated: 13–18 days**

