## 6. Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Per-pane quantity override:**
> Currently all panes show the same quantity (from `VisualizationStateResource`). Do you want per-pane quantity selection? E.g., pane 1 shows magnetization `m`, pane 2 shows effective field `h_eff`. This doubles field data in memory but is powerful for comparison.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Gizmo / transform tool timing:**
> ADR-0007 defines camera vs manipulate modes. Should geometry transform gizmos (move/rotate/scale) be part of Phase 5 viewport or deferred to Phase 4 geometry-authoring module?
